      "value": "@{5ae243864dc68c67fe796424|full_name}: I also think its only a matter of time until we get the feature from quest where Avatars are stuck in loading when your VRAM  is full. I hope it get's combined with the Imposters. That you loading Imposters instead of seeing a diamond if you can't load an avatar because of VRAM limit.",
